        "text": "Appearances at oral argument: Paul D. Polidoro (Petitioners), Abraham Cantor (Respondents), and David M. Gormley (Amicus Curiae for Ohio)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
