            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kennedy, justice Kennedy also questioned whether the mayor (or the government) has the right to demand prior registration before a person can speak to neighbors about neighborhood problems."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "59d8591f9a3dc92d965e0c54afa094ac5a2d844c2e761a81a4cb95aeae6eb7b9",
